@slide transition=fade duration=0.45
@bg color=#07111fff
@box x=110 y=70 w=1700 h=72 fontsize=52 color=#f8fbffff text=**Alignment that behaves.**
@box x=114 y=152 w=1692 h=42 fontsize=23 color=#7996aeff text=Horizontal and vertical alignment are authored properties—not layout accidents.
