Small text sits exactly where its source says it should.
@box x=740 y=284 w=440 h=510 fontsize=42 align=center valign=middle color=#eaf3ffff text=**Center / middle**
The complete laid-out block is centered.
@box x=1330 y=284 w=440 h=510 fontsize=42 align=right valign=bottom color=#eaf3ffff text=**Right / bottom**
Every visual line honors the edge.
